{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_049mom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_049mom01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8c105d0ae3204ba8e27ccd61c8a17756a9df88fa55a7b5c3c086476b52e02611", "ja": "桃子とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和桃子外出的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_049mom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_049mom01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eee2ce1115ba016c8168d8fb5ebbef7ec752df43c628fedf6200b24e795cd9bc", "ja": "（地方公演の間も、みんな様々な仕事をこなしている。\n桃子は、今日は一日中取材対応だ）", "zh": "（即使在地方公演期间，大家也都在做各种各样的工作。\n桃子今天一整天都在接受采访。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_049mom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_049mom01_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "66440d29bbf4cc960eedc87f9a7ea086780fd6e5e477c1ac3d788b1129f3b18c", "ja": "ありがとうございました！\n……ふう。お兄ちゃん、次はどこ？", "zh": "谢谢！\n……呼。哥哥，接下来要去哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_049mom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_049mom01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "80d051f289f7e3d2a3a9662b5b53f4a903addba3992cb9ea5c7b2a2c7d1e4f11", "ja": "次の取材は1時間後だから、すこし休憩しよう。\n疲れただろ？　桃子。", "zh": "下次采访是在1小时后，我们先休息一会儿吧。\n你也累了吧，桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_049mom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_049mom01_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "29b5202b784a0c48e565bc67fe15cd0e36cbcda74ecc40cecf4910ae9080f1b8", "ja": "そうなんだ。\n別に、桃子はすぐ次のお仕事でも平気だけど……。", "zh": "是这样啊。其实桃子马上接着工作也没关系，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_049mom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_049mom01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ca1532829a8dc3b3ad7aab4bf4d2cce8e35daf4303dc0554539d4e4b016f2bb7", "ja": "まあまあ。差し入れのみかんジュースがあるから、\n休憩しててくれ。休める時に休んでおかないとな。", "zh": "好啦好啦。这里有慰劳品橙汁，\n你先休息一下吧。能休息的时候就得好好休息啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_049mom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_049mom01_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "7a926901370fb38569ff47d9c9929db465c9e22860778bf5b3a0d58a69a3823a", "ja": "そう言うお兄ちゃんは、まだ仕事してるじゃない。\n……もう、しょうがないな。", "zh": "嘴上这么说，哥哥不还是在工作吗。\n……真是的，拿你没办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_049mom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_049mom01_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "780b70c730014c9de53013937e9ed22042ee6f629cf0f0dc920af6e5a819b669", "ja": "お兄ちゃん。ジュースと、コップをふたつ用意して。\n今すぐにね！", "zh": "哥哥。准备好果汁和两个杯子。\n现在马上哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_049mom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_049mom01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5d49733cbb40638dddda61371f4db816a3b9bf48970a2315a846a3ab62d9e2b6", "ja": "ああ、いいけど……。\nコップがふたついるのか？", "zh": "啊，可以是可以……不过，需要两个杯子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_049mom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_049mom01_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "d93cf4e2c9eed0384ffe0006062e9dee7336eb80de120c1c05634830b080c5e2", "ja": "ひとつは、お兄ちゃんの分。休める時に休まないと\nいけないのは、アイドルだけじゃないでしょ？", "zh": "一个是给哥哥的。该休息的时候不休息可不行，需要休息的又不只是偶像吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_049mom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_049mom01_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "c735ef058588c94a864cb65ea97d1f20d84604ed8e2e7706cd856b10f3ceadc2", "ja": "今日は特別に、桃子がジュース注いであげる。\nゆっくり味わって飲まなきゃダメだからね♪", "zh": "今天就特别让桃子给你倒果汁吧。\n要慢慢品尝着喝才行哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
